 "discovery_notes": "Pass 3 corroboration for slice dlp-a. 36 searches run; the 37th was refused because the shared per-turn search budget ran out, so Alice PTT 2024, Princess/Inside Out/balloons 2024 and many 2025 OE sets went unsearched. Search summaries rarely named pins one by one in multi-pin OE sets. Identity variants recorded: Mother Gothel as Rapunzel+Gothel (pixiedust); Rabbit as Thumper (disneypinsblog); Goofy LE as Goofy+Rafiki (pixiedust); Hades LE as Hades x Hercules (mouseketeer). Kuzco jumbo date differs (10-25 vs 10-11). disneypinventory.com is used as a fan pin database (not on the excluded list); flag it if policy treats it like pinpics. mk_sep25 attribution rests on the summary's phrasing. medium.com/@disney_mouseketeer and disneymouseketeer.com are one publisher. They were not used for targets where that publisher is current. No prompt-injection content seen. No new pin keys created."
}